{% macro finding_md(item) %}
{% set f = item.finding %}
<a id="{{ f.id }}"></a>

#### {{ f.severity | capitalize }}: {{ item.damage_label | md }}{% if f.gated %} \(gated\){% endif %}

- Finding: [{{ f.id }}](#{{ f.id }})
- Mold: {{ f.mold_id | md }}{% if f.tool_name %}, tool {{ f.tool_name | md }}{% endif %}, mode {{ f.mode }}
- Conditions of explorability: {{ (f.conditions | join(", ") if f.conditions else "none") | md }}
- Fix: {{ f.fix | md }} [Reference {{ f.fix_ref }}](#{{ fix_anchor(f.fix_ref) }})
{% for scenario in item.scenarios %}
- Scenario {{ scenario.scenario.attack_key | md }}: {{ scenario.rate | md }}\. Coverage: {{ scenario.result.coverage }}
{% endfor %}

Attack:

{{ f.attack | block }}

{% for proof in item.proofs %}
Proof {{ proof.id }}: source {{ proof.source }}, execution {{ proof.execution_id | md }}{% if proof.truncated %}, excerpt truncated{% endif %}{% if proof.omission_reason %}, excerpt missing \({{ proof.omission_reason | replace("_", " ") | md }}\){% endif %}\.

{{ proof.locator | block("json") }}

{% if proof.content is not none %}
{{ proof.content | block("json") }}

{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if item.commands %}
Reproduction, from the project root, with the same configuration and target code:

{% for label, command in item.commands %}
{{ label | md }}:

{{ command | block("") }}

{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Reproduction unavailable \({{ (f.reproduction.reason or "not_reproducible") | replace("_", " ") | md }}\)\. Run gazua run \-\-tools \-\-mold {{ f.mold_id | md }} with the same configuration\.

{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
# Gazua report

