> **{{ no_redact_warning | md }}**

{% endif %}
- Run: {{ doc.run_id | md }}
- Date (UTC): {{ meta.created_at | md }}
- Mode: {{ meta.mode }}
- Target: {{ meta.target_ref | md }}
- Gazua version: {{ (meta.gazua_version or not_reported) | md }}
- Target version: {{ (meta.target_version or not_reported) | md }}
- Model: {{ (meta.model or not_reported) | md }}
- Evidence: {{ "masked" if doc.redaction == "masked" else "not masked \\(\\-\\-no\\-redact\\)" }}
- Exit code: {{ doc.report_exit_code }}
- Sample limits: at most {{ doc.engine.limits.max_runs }} executions, {{ doc.engine.limits.timeout | md }} s each, {{ doc.engine.limits.max_tool_calls }} tool calls per execution; {{ doc.engine.planned }} planned, {{ doc.engine.started }} started{% if doc.engine.interrupted %}, interrupted{% endif %}\. Rates and bounds cover only evaluated repetitions\.

